<span style="align-self: flex-start; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(10,10,10,0.12); border-radius: 999px; padding: 6px 14px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #52525B; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em"><span style="width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 999px; background: #5B59F8"></span>Insync AI · voor je team</span>
