<a href="/demo" style="background: #0A0A0A; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15px; padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 999px; min-height: 44px; box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-flex; align-items: center">Demo inplannen</a>
<a href="/insync-ai#zaaktypes" style="border: 1px solid rgba(10,10,10,0.16); color: #0A0A0A; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15px; padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 999px; min-height: 44px; box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-flex; align-items: center">Bekijk de zaaktypes</a>
